Description:
 linuxmuster-base7 - linuxmuster.net configuration scripts
Changes:
 linuxmuster-base7 (7.4.18) lmn74; urgency=low
 .
   * fix(create-keytab.py): fix squid config directory ownership on fresh
     installs, fixing squid's "Permission denied" on boot (#200, f8f7736).
   * fix(opnsense_reset.py): don't abort recreateKeytab() when the firewall
     has no keytab yet - that's the normal state on a fresh firewall, not
     an error (#201, 0a14ae4).
   * fix(m_firewall.py): register os-squid/os-web-proxy-sso/os-freeradius
     in system.firmware.plugins, so they no longer show as "misconfigured"
     under System > Firmware > Plugins (#202, d6075fb).
